      "summary": "Escape key event does not stop propagation, leading to unintended behavior.",
      "scenario": "When the user presses the Escape key while renaming a conversation, the rename is canceled and the event propagates to the global listener, which closes the entire chat panel. This results in one press performing two actions: canceling the rename and closing the chat panel.",
